<title>USA: Physicians completes Citation merger.</title>
<headline>Physicians completes Citation merger.</headline>
<dateline>PICKERINGTON, Ohio 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Physicians Insurance Co of Ohio said on Thursday that it has closed the previously announced reverse merger with Citation Insurance Group, effective November 20, 1996.</p>
<p>Each Physicians Insurance Co of Ohio shareholder will receive 5.0099 shares of Citation stock in the deal and cash will be paid in lieu of fractional shares, Physicians Insurance said.</p>
<p>Physicians Insurance is changing its name to PICO Holdings effective November 21, the company said.</p>
</text>
